    "created_at": "2016-03-23T19:15:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-23T19:15:49Z",
    "body": "Do the 2 pages on the same device share the same CCCD?\nIf I add a descriptor for my service, can I write to it in our current spec?\n\nThanks for your time.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
